---
description: Prepare one resolveConflicts evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: TransitionTask[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Propose permitted logistical alternatives when providers or times change, explaining consequences for the approved plan. Escalate any alternative that could alter clinical requirements and keep the transition blocked until the appropriate team resolves the conflict. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
